OL,3,ACalifornia governor commutes sentences
OL,4,Afor state's 548 death row inmates
OL,5,
OL,6,FCalifornia Governor Gavin Newsom has
OL,7,Fcommuted the death sentences of all 548
OL,8,Fpeople on death row in the state,
OL,9,Fchanging them instead to life in
OL,10,Fprison.
OL,12,F"We can now let these offenders die in
OL,13,Fobscurity while we forever remember and
OL,14,Fhonour the victims," he said in a
OL,15,Fletter.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
