OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACalifornia governor commutes sentences
OL,4,Afor state's 548 death row inmates
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision to spare death row inmates
OL,7,Fis largely symbolic in a state that has
OL,8,Fnot executed an inmate since 2006,
OL,9,Fthough experts say it could save
OL,10,Fmillions of dollars in court costs each
OL,11,Fyear. Only 13 inmates have been
OL,12,Fexecuted since voters reinstated the
OL,13,Fdeath penalty in 1978.
OL,15,FThe decision comes as Newsom, the
OL,16,FDemocratic leader of the most populous
OL,17,FUS state, has been discussed as a
OL,18,Fpossible 2028 contender for president.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
